      {  
         "ID": 94,  
         "description": "The vehicle's control systems must assist the driver in executing lane changes by compensating for crosswinds. This compensation should be based on inputs from steering angle and acceleration sensors to ensure stability and safety during lane changes."
      },  
      {  
         "ID": 8,  
         "description": "The system is required to log data related to accelerator pedal operation. This logging is essential for troubleshooting purposes and fault analysis, ensuring that any issues with the accelerator can be diagnosed and resolved efficiently."
